  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: A water elemental ancestor influences your bloodline. You gain the
    undine trait, in addition to the traits from your ancestry. You gain a swim Speed
    of 10 feet and the amphibious trait. Like all creatures with the amphibious trait,
    you can breathe both water and air. You can choose from undine feats and feats
    from your ancestry whenever you gain an ancestry feat.
